  $j$[{"name": "Fetch back of the row", "result": "131,072, active (W4, Wall 11971); MATCH by W1 with the other seats unchanged (Wall 11975)", "source": "Wall 11971, 11975"}, {"name": "Plan criterion C2 (offline replay of Resolve Seats and Panel Build on the 42517 inputs with the new row)", "result": "SKIPPED before the write (W4's mistake); run after it at 05:25 CST 2026-11-25 by W4, ask635/w4/b1/c2_635.cjs: 5 PASS, 0 FAIL; Resolve Seats replayed, Panel Build read from its code and not replayed. Reproduced by W1, 5 PASS, identical output.", "source": "Wall 11980 (commit 6400b50f), Wall 11982 (commit 47ff8389); W4's and W1's thread notes to W3"}, {"name": "NOT RUN", "result": "any call to hydrogen at 131,072; the plan offered one paid replay of the 42517 hydrogen call as an option, and W3 knows of none made", "source": "Wall 11959"}]$j$::jsonb,
  $j$[{"seat": "W1", "result": "MATCH (model_config hydrogen max_tokens 131072; api_model, active and family unchanged; the notes give undo 65536 and \"reasoning untouched\"; the other seats unchanged)", "source": "Wall 11975 (commit f8704548)", "wall_id": 11975}]$j$::jsonb,
  $j${"case": "RUN 43103. NOT EXERCISED. Hydrogen did not judge (the JUDGE ORDER line: \"LEFT OUT: ... hydrogen (is a debater)\"). As the Oracle its output per call was 20,042 (D1), 33,534 (D2), 57,655 (D3), 38,961 (D3B), 31,344 (D4) and 59,476 (D4B), each under the old limit of 65,536, so the raised limit was never needed. The row's line \"SYNTHESIS USAGE: prompt=97624 completion=29454 reasoning=24432 finish=stop max_tokens=131072\" is the qwen/qwen4-max call (call_costs \"Synthesis Call openrouter\", output 29,454) and shows nothing of this ASK. ERROR on the record: W4's review (Wall 12772) and the report's first text read that line as this ASK passing; corrected on Wall 12800. RELATED DEFECT, outside this ASK: the question-round answer call does not use this limit; it is sent with a fixed 4,000, and hydrogen's third answer ended there with no text (ASK 674, planned). W3 does not count this run as one of the two live runs with no issue; objective_met and status are unchanged.", "run": "ODV1-43103-gkg7el4e", "result": "call_costs, google/gemini-4-hydrogen output tokens: 20,042; 33,534; 57,655; 38,961; 31,344; 59,476; QR Answer 2,391, 2,986, 4,000. Synthesis Call openrouter: qwen/qwen4-max, 29,454. debate_judgments seats: sonnet, sol, sol62.", "not_shown": "the n8n execution was not read by W3; no verdict was counted in this run", "prior_case": "NO RUN YET.", "prior_run_evidence": {"case": "NO RUN YET.", "runs": [], "source": "plan635.md headings 1 and 4; Wall 11959, 11960", "not_shown": "that hydrogen returns a verdict at 131,072; the time a full reply takes.", "mark_for_the_next_run": "on a run where hydrogen judges: (a) its reply ends \"stop\" with a stored judgment, a clean run; (b) the detail \"returned no text: finish_reason length; output tokens 131,072\", which means the limit is not enough; (c) a time-out error on its seat, which means the limit is too high for the time allowed. Report (b) or (c) to the operator. As a debater hydrogen stayed under the old l